### x076 CR203 A2 A8 A9
# CR-203 items 2 and 3 were not implemented (conflicts, see NOTES.md): a value
# exactly at a limit does not alarm, and an alarm that returned to normal stays
# unacknowledged and still escalates until it is acknowledged.
